# ViewMD Presentation Engine
### Fast, Minimal & Interactive Slide Decks from Plain Markdown

- **File Extension**: Native support for `.mdp` and `.deck` files
- **Slide Separation**: Simple `---` (3 dashes) between slides
- **6 Themed Palettes**: Midnight, Tokyo Night, Mocha, Paper, Daylight, Obsidian
- **Interactive Slides**: Embedded Canvas animations, live SVGs, and interactive widgets
- **Deckrun Compatible**: Smart layout directives (`"right"`, `"left"`, `"bg"`)
- **Laser Pointer**: Glowing trailing laser-pen tool (<kbd>L</kbd>) that auto-hides
- **Slide Whiteboard**: Built-in `tldraw` sketch canvas (<kbd>W</kbd>) with in-memory persistence
- **Export to PDF**: Dedicated 16:9 vector print engine for keynote presentations

---

# Slide Syntax & Frontmatter
### Author Keynote Decks in Pure Plaintext

Each `.mdp` deck starts with optional YAML frontmatter configuring deck-wide properties:

```yaml
---
title: "Distributed Systems Architecture"
theme: "tokyo-night" # midnight | tokyo-night | mocha | paper | daylight | obsidian
aspectRatio: "16:9"   # 16:9 | 4:3 | 16:10
author: "Your Name"
---
```

Slides are separated by `---` on an empty line:

```markdown
# Slide Title
Slide content here...

---

# Next Slide
More bullet points...
```

> **Smart Parser**: Delimiters inside fenced code blocks are protected and will never accidentally split your slides!

