| **Mocha** | Warm Catppuccin espresso | `#1e1e2e` | Mauve & Rosewater | Plus Jakarta + Fira Code |
| **Paper** | Editorial warm newsprint | `#faf8f5` | Charcoal & Amber | Serif (Georgia) + Mono |
| **Daylight** | Clean Swiss modern light | `#f8fafc` | Deep Slate & Blue | Inter + Roboto Mono |
| **Obsidian** | High-contrast OLED pitch | `#000000` | Lime Green (`#a3e635`) | Geist / Inter + Mono |

Switch themes live anytime using the **Theme Dropdown** in the header or by pressing the palette button on the floating HUD.

