# Split Layout Directive (`"right"`)
### Deckrun-Compatible Smart Image Placement

![Server Architecture](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop "right opacity:0.9")

- Add `"right"` to the image title:
  `![Alt](url "right")`
- Automatically creates a 50/50 split layout
- Text docks cleanly on the left
- Media docks cleanly on the right
- Opacity modifiers supported:
  `"right opacity:0.85"`
- Zero CSS or complex formatting needed

---

# Split Layout Directive (`"left"`)
### Media-First Visual Slide Presentations

![Clean Workspace](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop "left")

- Add `"left"` to the image title:
  `![Alt](url "left")`
- Places visual media on the left panel
- Content and bullet points on the right
- Responsive auto-scaling maintains proportions on any display resolution
- Ideal for walkthroughs, hardware diagrams, and screenshots

