# Animated SVG Graphics
### Crisp Vector Diagrams & CSS Keyframes

<div class="flex items-center justify-center py-6">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 240 240" class="w-72 h-72 select-none">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="neonGlow" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#38bdf8" />
        <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#bb9af7" />
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#f43f5e" />
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <!-- Outer Orbit -->
    <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="90" fill="none" stroke="url(#neonGlow)" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="24 12" class="animate-spin" style="transform-origin: center; animation-duration: 14s;" />
    <!-- Mid Orbit -->
    <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="60" fill="none" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="12 8" class="animate-spin" style="transform-origin: center; animation-duration: 8s; animation-direction: reverse;" />
    <!-- Center Core -->
    <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="22" fill="#bb9af7" opacity="0.9" />
    <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="10" fill="#ffffff" />
    <!-- Orbiting Satellite -->
    <circle cx="210" cy="120" r="7" fill="#f43f5e" />
  </svg>
</div>

- Full inline SVG support via `rehype-raw`
- Seamless Tailwind animation utilities (`animate-spin`, `animate-pulse`, `animate-bounce`)
- Scales cleanly to 4K projectors without pixelation

