# Keynote Code Highlighting
### Syntax Highlighting with Highlight.js

```typescript
import { parsePresentation, getTheme } from './plugins/presentation';

// 1. Parse markdown text into structured slides and layout directives
const presentation = parsePresentation(markdownContent);

// 2. Load theme configuration with typography and accent colors
const theme = getTheme('tokyo-night');

console.log(`Loaded ${presentation.totalSlides} keynote slides`);
```

> "Make it work, make it right, make it fast." — Kent Beck

- High-contrast syntax tokens matching the active dark/light palette
- Preserves line breaks, indentation, and monospaced font alignment

