# Navigation & Presenter Tools
### Keyboard-First Ergonomics for Technical Speakers

- **<kbd>→</kbd> / <kbd>Space</kbd> / <kbd>PageDown</kbd>**: Advance to next slide
- **<kbd>←</kbd> / <kbd>Backspace</kbd> / <kbd>PageUp</kbd>**: Return to previous slide
- **<kbd>Home</kbd> / <kbd>End</kbd>**: Jump to the first / last slide
- **<kbd>F</kbd>**: Toggle Fullscreen Presentation Mode
- **<kbd>O</kbd> / <kbd>Esc</kbd>**: Open the **Slide Overview Grid** to visually browse thumbnails
- **<kbd>L</kbd>**: Toggle **Glowing Laser Pointer** with fading trails & auto-hide
- **<kbd>P</kbd>**: Toggle **Persistent Slide Pen** to draw on top of slides (saved in memory)
- **<kbd>W</kbd>**: Open **Slide Whiteboard** (`tldraw`) for full canvas sketching (saved per slide)
- **<kbd>?</kbd>**: Open **In-App MDP Documentation & Hotkeys Guide**
- **Text Density Control**: Use `<!-- size: compact -->` or the toolbar selector for dense slides
- **Floating Presenter HUD**: Bottom control bar with quick controls (fades on idle)

